              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "THE VISUALISATION CHALLENGE",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe (Bold)",
                      "fontSize": "24pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Top chart (Standard Scale)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Notice how the extreme outliers compress all normal values into a thin line at the bottom."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "You cannot distinguish between items that took 10 minutes vs 50 minutes — they all appear the same."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Data labels are useless, as display units that work for large values don't work for small ones, and vice versa."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Bottom chart (Logarithmic Scale)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "While this makes all bars visible, the scale is difficult to interpret. The visual distance between bars no longer represents the actual difference in processing time. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Most senior stakeholders find this confusing."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The following pages demonstrate more effective approaches.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
